ose</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Omata</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Endoscopic submucosal dissection of esophageal squamous cell neoplasms</article-title><source>Clin. Gastroenterol. Hepatol.</source><volume>4</volume><fpage>688</fpage><lpage>694</lpage><year>2006</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16713746</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kakushima</surname><given-names>N.</given-names></name><name><surname>Yahagi</surname><given-names>N.</given-names></name><name><surname>Fujishiro</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Kodashima</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Nakamura</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Omata</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Efficacy and safety of endoscopic submucosal dissection for tumors of the esophagogastric junction</article-title><source>Endoscopy</source><volume>38</volume><fpage>170</fpage><lpage>174</lpage><year>2006</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16479425</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yoshinaga</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Gotoda</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name><name><surname>Kusano</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Oda</surname><given-names>I.</given-names></name><name><surname>Nakamura</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Takayanagi</surname><given-names>R.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Clinical impact of endoscopic submucosal dissection for superficial adenocarcinoma located at the esophagogastric junction</article-title><source>Gastrointest. Endosc.</source><volume>67</volume><fpage>202</fpage><lpage>209</l